  "description": "Revenue meter (default Modbus register map)",
  "revision": 3,
  "revised": "2026-10-18",
  "source": "Schneider Electric, Modbus protocol and register map for ION devices, 70022-0124-01 (08/2011), section Modbus register map ION8600",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "PowerLogic ION Meters Modbus Protocol and Register Map",
      "version": "70022-0124-01",
      "date": "2011-08",
      "url": "https://www.se.com/us/en/download/document/70022-0124-01/",
      "note": "Modbus Slave module registers, section ION8600"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The register map of an ION meter has a part you configure (the Modbus Slave modules) and a fixed part. This map is the default Modbus Slave module map of the template revisions named by the manufacturer; if the meter has a custom framework, the registers can be elsewhere.",
    "Addresses are the 4xxxx register numbers of the manual minus 40000, as sent on the wire (register 40011 is address 10). Values are read with FC03; FC16 writes the registers marked read/write.",
    "32-bit values have the high-order register first. A value shown with a scale is the register divided by the scaling of the module (11982 with scaling 10 is 1198.2). The units are inferred from the register labels.",
    "Unmapped registers between blocks read as 0xFFFF.",
    "Not in this map: the 32-bit modulus-10000 (M10K) energy registers, and the common Modbus registers for setup and control.",
    "Default template revisions: This table outlines the default data registers available on the ION8600 power meters. This register map is applicable to the following template revisions:  8600A_V330_FAC_V3.3.0.0.0  8600A_V330_FAC-35S_V3.3.0.0.0  8600B_V330_FAC_V3.3.0.0.0  8600B_V330_FAC-35S_V3.3.0.0.0  8600C_V330_FAC_V3.3.0.0.0  8600C_V330_FAC-35S_V3.3.0.0.0 And the following RMICAN approved frameworks, to be used with v321 firmware:  8600A_"
  ],
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
